and composition, then lighting, colors and finer details.\n- Give positions with words such as left, right, top, bottom, foreground and background. No coordinates, lists, headings, JSON or Markdown.\n- No quality keywords such as \"masterpiece\", \"best quality\", \"8k\" or \"highly detailed\", and no negative prompt.\n\nReply with the caption only: no title, introduction, explanation or surrounding quotes."], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "value"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "title": "Text (System prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [359.68988037109375, 455.95330810546875], "pos": [863.7374267578125, 0], "id": 21, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [46], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#232", "widgets_values": [""], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 50, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "Negative Prompt (empty = reference default)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [451.4173278808594, 176.13780212402344], "pos": [1893.6177978515625, 0], "id": 31, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.41.0", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.8"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 18}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [45], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDI